{"unit_id":"tag:04D5:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 是拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）。函子（functor）<MATH_0002> 一般只有左正合（left exact）性。可对此函子（functor）施加许多附加条件，以区分拓扑斯态射（morphisms of topoi）的特定类（classes）。在此汇集这些条件，并指出一些逻辑上的依赖关系。下面引理的某些部分纯属范畴（category）论（即不依赖于有一个拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi），只需有一对伴随函子（adjoint functors）即可）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"classes","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"adjoint functors","target_term":"伴随函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"left exact","target_term":"左正合","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"classes","target_term":"类","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"adjoint functors","target_term":"伴随函子","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
